{"5135030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Neko Room Days","steam_appid":5135030,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5151090],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neko Room Days<\/strong> is a cozy 2D pixel-art room-decorating sim where you create a home for cats and unwind to mellow lo-fi music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your cats, arrange furniture, or use the music and built-in timers while you work. Whatever you are in the mood for, spend your time in the cat room your own way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/9c8c0f4764e16290e145b564a6da4a8f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Home Full of Little Cat Moments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cats roam freely around the room, eating, drinking, playing, and curling up in their favorite spots. Pet and brush them, get to know each cat on their own terms, and watch friendships grow as they spend time together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/b379a80a283190c01adfc7553d3ba565.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/336516591b469cee024dc2297eab80a4.avif?t=1793765717\" width=70 height=70 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/40442c20e11e91458afc6981a7fee113.avif?t=1793765717\" width=69 height=69 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/a14c32f7bcf58c835c06fb9320552f7f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=70 height=70 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/6cc7083492d7242597dd415eec5a568b.avif?t=1793765717\" width=75 height=75 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/cd0ffe005e452ad55e4669ff8ddf03dd.avif?t=1793765717\" width=69 height=69 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/a2cf6816cf4ff6c5938056a51b7015c3.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make the Cat Room Your Own<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life together begins in a compact studio apartment. Collect and arrange more than 20 types of furniture, including cat beds, towers, tunnels, toys, and a cozy kotatsu.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your level rises, new places to live become available, including a traditional Japanese room, a high-rise apartment, and a resort villa. Each of the six rooms takes on a different atmosphere in the morning, afternoon, and at night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/74477b1766ec2940845e0bd98ee66427.avif?t=1793765717\" width=520 height=292 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/1b1d45d73936220442e2c9d9a4ff94fa.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lo-Fi for Focus and Relaxation<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six albums featuring 60+ lo-fi tracks. Skip to the next track, shuffle playback, or turn on repeat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pomodoro timer and stopwatch run independently of the music and can be used at the same time. Let the cats and music keep you company while you work, study, or read.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/3022b6e5f70ad8e73e58dd770c9e012f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=220 height=220 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/bd27fde1510cfa4589ba5e60c653ac5f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=220 height=220 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/6204324c1a3645e6010c23aa45131f44.avif?t=1793765717\" width=220 height=220 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/be88059685d6262e51da986b11543b8c.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everyday Moments Become Memories<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first time caring for a cat, the changing atmosphere from morning to night, discovering new rooms and furniture, and seeing two cats grow closer—these moments can all be recorded as Memories as you reach milestones throughout the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your cats take on part-time jobs and wait for them to come home, or hide the UI and simply enjoy the room and music. There is no need to rush. Spend time with your cats and make memories at your own pace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A little company on your taskbar while you work<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and let your cats step out of their room and onto your desktop.<br>Watch them stroll along your taskbar or curl up for a peaceful nap. Whether you’re working or studying, they’ll quietly keep you company.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your favorite lo-fi music and make your everyday tasks a little cozier, with cats by your side.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/47fe68dc2fe8fff32cb0a108aeba2466.avif?t=1793765717\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras_big\/47fe68dc2fe8fff32cb0a108aeba2466.avif?t=1793765717 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Neko Room Days<\/strong> is a cozy 2D pixel-art room-decorating sim where you create a home for cats and unwind to mellow lo-fi music.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Care for your cats, arrange furniture, or use the music and built-in timers while you work. Whatever you are in the mood for, spend your time in the cat room your own way.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/9c8c0f4764e16290e145b564a6da4a8f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A Home Full of Little Cat Moments<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cats roam freely around the room, eating, drinking, playing, and curling up in their favorite spots. Pet and brush them, get to know each cat on their own terms, and watch friendships grow as they spend time together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/b379a80a283190c01adfc7553d3ba565.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/336516591b469cee024dc2297eab80a4.avif?t=1793765717\" width=70 height=70 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/40442c20e11e91458afc6981a7fee113.avif?t=1793765717\" width=69 height=69 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/a14c32f7bcf58c835c06fb9320552f7f.avif?t=1793765717\" width=70 height=70 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/6cc7083492d7242597dd415eec5a568b.avif?t=1793765717\" width=75 height=75 \/><\/span>　<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/cd0ffe005e452ad55e4669ff8ddf03dd.avif?t=1793765717\" width=69 height=69 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/a2cf6816cf4ff6c5938056a51b7015c3.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Make the Cat Room Your Own<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life together begins in a compact studio apartment. Collect and arrange more than 20 types of furniture, including cat beds, towers, tunnels, toys, and a cozy kotatsu.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your level rises, new places to live become available, including a traditional Japanese room, a high-rise apartment, and a resort villa. Each of the six rooms takes on a different atmosphere in the morning, afternoon, and at night.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/74477b1766ec2940845e0bd98ee66427.avif?t=1793765717\" width=520 height=292 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/1b1d45d73936220442e2c9d9a4ff94fa.avif?t=1793765717\" width=64 height=64 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Lo-Fi for Focus and Relaxation<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from six albums featuring 60+ lo-fi tracks. Skip to the next track, shuffle playback, or turn on repeat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pomodoro timer and stopwatch run independently of the music and can be used at the same time. Let the cats and music keep you company while you work, study, or read.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstati