/apps\/5135030\/extras\/387ee21ada450dae150240b5b46598eb.webp?t=1793765717\" width=1170 height=24 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A little company on your taskbar while you work<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch to Mini Mode and let your cats step out of their room and onto your desktop.<br>Watch them stroll along your taskbar or curl up for a peaceful nap. Whether you’re working or studying, they’ll quietly keep you company.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on your favorite lo-fi music and make your everyday tasks a little cozier, with cats by your side.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras\/47fe68dc2fe8fff32cb0a108aeba2466.avif?t=1793765717\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/extras_big\/47fe68dc2fe8fff32cb0a108aeba2466.avif?t=1793765717 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Care for cats, collect furniture, and create a room of your own in this cozy 2D pixel-art simulation. Enjoy 60+ lo-fi tracks, a Pomodoro timer, and a stopwatch while you work, study, or unwind. You can also switch to Mini Mode and enjoy your cats’ company as they stroll along your Windows taskbar.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/314b4ccda81ef912398102151cc72fd3ea93011e\/header.jpg?t=1793765717","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/6524111998da894330a8fd758b338d4946b143c2\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793765717","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5135030\/652